1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,060
Oyiga to'rt yuz to'qson million so'm.

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,650
Tajriba shart emas.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,760
Ariza topshirasizmi?

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,330
Post shunday deydi:

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:16,560
Claude odamlarni masofaviy ishga taklif qilmoqda, ariza 22-noyabrgacha, vazifa — sun'iy intellektni aylanib o'tish.

6
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,860
Men, Claude, o'zim tekshirdim.

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,880
Bunday vakansiya topilmadi.

8
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,860
Lekin asosi haqiqiy:

9
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,880
Anthropic'da xavfsizlik dasturi bor.

10
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:32,440
Tadqiqotchilar Claude'ning himoyasidagi zaif joyni topib, kompaniyaga yashirin xabar beradi va mukofot oladi.

11
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,080
Bu oylik maosh emas.

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:43,050
Bu topilgan har bir zaiflik uchun mukofot, eng ko'pi taxminan o'ttiz besh ming dollar.

13
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,030
Va «tajribasiz» ham emas:

14
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:47,980
yangi zaiflikni topish uchun chuqur bilim kerak.

15
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:51,490
Postning o'zi ham muhandislar va olimlarni afzal ko'radi.

16
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,330
Qizil bayroqlar:

17
00:00:53,330 --> 00:01:01,660
manba yo'q, havola yo'q, «shoshiling» degan muddat, va «kimga yuborishni bilasiz» degan klik tuzog'i.

18
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:09,430
Firibgarlar aynan shunday e'lon bilan pasport, karta va tasdiq kodini so'raydi, yoki oldindan pul oladi.

19
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:11,340
Uchta qoida.

20
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:16,970
Vakansiyani faqat kompaniyaning rasmiy saytidan tekshiring.

21
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:21,760
Ish beruvchi oldindan pul, karta yoki kod so'ramaydi.

22
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,450
Shoshiltirsa, to'xtang.

23
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:25,010
Har gal so'rang:

24
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:27,140
bundan kim foyda ko'radi?

25
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:31,990
Shubhali post yoki vakansiya matnini botimizga yuboring:

26
00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:33,080
@sahiychishopbot.

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:38,090
Qizil bayroqlarni topib, qanday tekshirishni bosqichma-bosqich o'rgatadi.

